// Kazhmira is placed directly in BG0125 by the area script.
// Her CRE is based directly on Dark Horizons' Isolde and keeps Isolde's
// original general/default behaviour, except that the default script below
// makes her hostile immediately instead of waiting for Tristan to be attacked.
IF
  Global("QCHU_BG0125","BG0125",0)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobal("QCHU_BG0125","BG0125",1)
    CreateCreature("QCKAZHM",[850.401],0)
END
